,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-30T10:48:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T17:53:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T17:53:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced in Godot Engine v4.7.stable.official.5b4e0cb0f honestly I havent tested on other version because I intend to open a PR to fix this, it should be easy I think it was introduced in commit 4497e2a0d3 so it should be after 4.5\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 Godot Engine v4.7.stable.official.5b4e0cb0f OpenGL API 3.3.0 NVIDIA 581.80 - Compatibility - Using Device: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 6GB Laptop GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis can affect people running project that uses custom resource classes, plugins or GDExtension classes, and the user opens or refreshes Debugger - Video RAM. While the project is running it reports information about loaded textures and meshes automatically. This can cause an resource type that may be known to the running project but not to the editor, like for example because a custom class is only registered at runtime, Im not familiar with plugins but I reckon it can also happen there if it has a different editor and runtime loading states\n\nWhile I recorded the video I hit end task and all displays temporarily went black and the screen recording froze (you can see it) Im not really sure if this was a windows issue or secondary effect of the unresponsive process though\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2df2fe3-4dbd-48b6-b5a8-c39bcd8676d7\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Import and open the MRP.\n2. Run the project\n3. In the window press hte SEND UNKNOWN button once\n4. The editor becomes unresponsive and you have to terminate the process\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[memory_usage_dos_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30542496/memory_usage_dos_mrp.zip)\n\nI'm working on the PR for this But I thoght I should first create an Issue","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repit